name></person-group><article-title>The Continuous Glucose Monitoring System during pregnancy of women with type 1 diabetes mellitus: accuracy assessment</article-title><source>Diabetes Technol Ther</source><year>2004</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>645</fpage><lpage>51</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15628818</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/dia.2004.6.645</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>